        {
          "text": "Kwa maana akapajenga tena mahali pa juu alipopabomoa Hezekia babaye; akazisimamisha madhabahu za mabaali, akafanya na sanamu za maashera, akaabudu jeshi lote la mbinguni, na kulitumikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
