        {
          "text": "Tena akawapitisha wanawe motoni katika bonde la mwana wa Hinomu; akatazama bao, akabashiri, akafanya uganga, akajishughulisha na hao wenye pepo wa utambuzi, na wachawi; akafanya mabaya mengi machoni pa BWANA, hata kumkasirisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
